# WarriorPetForPC (16013), a tamed beast whose first spawn parameter names the character: it
# keeps him as its owner and, on its 5 in 100 draw, names him in one of its five greetings (sent
# as the NPC lines' NPCs spawn, before the first step). A claim of the owner naming a later
# game tick than the beast's own makes it leave; one of the same tick, or of another player,
# does not.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/warrior_pet_owner.golden
character Hunter 20
random 4 1
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.WarriorPetForPC
npc beast 16013 Monster 40 0 0 params character 2188 0

event beast 10022 character 0
event beast 10022 77 5
event beast 10022 character 1
  S DeleteObject obj=beast
  live 16013 0
